# A scripted ride for the goldens: wait a second on the pad (riding starts
# once the dunes' collider is in), then full throttle north up the lane. The
# chase camera tops the crest near frame 640; the rider camera then sees the
# block ahead.
#   functor -d examples/hoverbike run native -- --input-script ride.script \
#     --capture-frame /tmp/f.png --capture-at-frame 640 --capture-size 1600x1200
60 W down
700 C down
701 C up
